<title>UK: Syria tenders to buy raw or white sugar -traders.</title>
<headline>Syria tenders to buy raw or white sugar -traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria tendered to buy one or two cargoes of either white or raw sugar for delivery in February/March, traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Syria tendered on December 14 to buy 13,000 tonnes of white and 13,000 tonnes of raws but cancelled it due to a mistake in the terms submitted by one potential supplier.</p>
<p>-- Jeremy Smith, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
